    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>¡Y arroja a <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003> y <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004>\nal<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ninterior<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nla<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nCueva Talasia!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 19,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 7528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Al presenciar dicho suceso, <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>,\nquien custodia la megaevolución...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 7684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C002000700072006500730065006E006300690061007200200064006900630068006F002000730075006300650073006F002C002000100002018B0001002C000A0071007500690065006E00200063007500730074006F0064006900610020006C00610020006D00650067006100650076006F006C00750063006900F3006E002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Decide otorgarle su poder a <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>\nen reconocimiento de su valentía y fortaleza.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 7832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento histórico: ¡es el primer ser humano\nque megaevoluciona!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 8000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0020006800690073007400F3007200690063006F003A002000A10065007300200065006C0020007000720069006D006500720020007300650072002000680075006D0061006E006F000A0071007500650020006D00650067006100650076006F006C007500630069006F006E0061002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tras contemplar con sus propios ojos lo ocurrido,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002> no pierde la esperanza...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 8144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y se reafirma en la convicción de un día obtener\nuna Megapiedra con su propio nombre.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 8316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno, yo creo que se va a convertir en un éxito\nde ventas, ¿no te parece?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 8496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Seguro que sí!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 8656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100530065006700750072006F00200071007500650020007300ED00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No sé yo...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 8688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020007300E900200079006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Genial! Ahora he de finiquitar el manuscrito para\nenviárselo a la Editorial Luminalia.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 8712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡No lo habría conseguido sin tu ayuda! Cuando\nsalga a la venta, espero que me sigas apoyando.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 8896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    }
